---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GhostWord from '../components/GhostWord.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — 刘启征"
  description="Digital Media Technology student in Suzhou — short films, game levels, VFX, and the account that publishes them."
>
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <GhostWord text="About" />
    <h1 class="t-display">
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--i:0">About—</span></span>
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm 刘启征 (Lin). I make films, game levels and VFX — from the first sketch to
        the exported file. I model and light the sets myself, cut them myself, and
        publish them myself.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        我是刘启征，苏州健雄职业技术学院数字媒体技术在读。影像、游戏场景、特效，
        从第一张草图到导出文件都自己做：自己搭场景、自己打光、自己剪、自己发。
      </p>

      <p>
        AI is one tool on that desk, not the author. I use it where it actually saves
        time — concept passes, textures, variations I would never hand-draw — and I
        throw away most of what it gives me. What stays mine is the judgment: what to
        keep, what to cut, and whether the thing is worth publishing at all.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        AI 是我桌上的一件工具，不是作者。只在真能省时间的地方用它 —— 概念稿、贴图、
        我手绘不出来的变化；它给的东西大部分我会扔掉。留下来的判断权还是我的：
        留什么、剪什么、这东西到底值不值得发。
      </p>

      <p>
        Right now three things run at once: a short film about 王阳明, a Wuxia action
        level in Unreal Engine 5, and an account that ships whatever comes out. Making
        is cheap now. Finishing and shipping is the skill.
      </p>

      <h3>What I work with</h3>
      <p>
        Unreal Engine 5 · Blender &amp; particle VFX · Premiere / DaVinci · Figma ·
        HTML / CSS / JS · AI image &amp; video generation (ComfyUI, Stable Diffusion) ·
        writing &amp; editing.
      </p>

      <h3>Now</h3>
      <p>
        Building one pipeline from first sketch to release, and documenting what breaks
        along the way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-aside" data-reveal style="--d:1">
      <div>
        <h4>Based in</h4>
        <p>苏州 Suzhou, China</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Studying</h4>
        <p>Digital Media Technology<br />Suzhou Chien-Shiung Institute of Technology</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Direction</h4>
        <p>AIGC · Game engine · VFX · Self-media</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Tools</h4>
        <p>UE5 · Blender · Premiere · Figma · ComfyUI</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p>
          <a class="link-u" href="mailto:Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com" data-cursor="hover"
            >Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>
